{"item_uid": "指考100-math_jia-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分作答示例：請仔細閱讀下面的例子。", "stem": "考慮坐標平面上滿足 2x =5y 的點 P(x,y)，試問下列哪一個選項是錯誤的？\n(1) (0,0) 是一個可能的 P 點\n(2) (log5,log2) 是一個可能的 P 點\n(3) 點 P(x,y) 滿足 xy≥0\n(4) 所有可能的點 P(x,y) 構成的圖形為一直線\n(5) 點 P 的 x,y 坐標可以同時為正整數", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 2.0, "2": 5.0, "3": 5.0, "4": 19.0, "5": 69.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 1.0, "3": 2.0, "4": 6.0, "5": 90.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 4.0, "2": 11.0, "3": 8.0, "4": 33.0, "5": 44.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 83.0, 74.0, 62.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
